fides
------------------------------------------
Fides is a library that provides a schema for reading and writing data stored
in ADIOS2 using a JSON-based data model, and for turning it into Viskores
datasets for visualization.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libadios2-devel-2.12.1-1bl2
  libadios2_2.12-2.12.1-1bl2
  libfides-devel-1.3.0-1bl1
  libfides1-1.3.0-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  libviskores-devel-1.2.0-1bl1
  libviskores1.2-1.2.0-1bl1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libadios2-devel-2.12.1-1bl2
  libviskores-devel-1.2.0-1bl1
  ninja-1.13.2-1
  rapidjson-devel-1.1.0p577-1

Canonical website:
  https://gitlab.kitware.com/vtk/fides

Canonical download:
  https://gitlab.kitware.com/vtk/fides/-/archive/v1.3.0/fides-v1.3.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack fides-1.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./fides-1.3.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/fides-1.3.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/fides-1.3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfides1-1.3.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libfides-devel-1.3.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

